# CHECK: = CallDirect [[scope]], {{*}}function=f3
# RUN(NOTHING): walk f2 mechanisms=all
# NOTHING-NOT: GetCapture
# NOTHING-NOT: field=1
# RUN(BESIDES): walk f3 mechanisms=all
# BESIDES: b0([[scope]]: env L0
# BESIDES: [[limit]]: {{*}} = GetCapture {{*}}function=f2 index=1
# BESIDES: = CallDirect [[scope]], [[limit]], {{*}}function=f2
# RUN(WITHHELD): walk f2 mechanisms=all-DirectCalls
# WITHHELD-NOT: CallDirect
# RUN(ANSWERS): run-in-shell
# ANSWERS: the source prints the same

